# ── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing in this repository may contain a real key. The Fish Audio key lives
# in the FISH_AUDIO_API_KEY environment variable and the OpenCode Go key is read
# from OpenCode's own auth.json - neither is ever written to a file here.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

# ── Personal working notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The phase reports are private development notes, not project documentation.
/reports/

# ── VRM model (face) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 止丸式初音ミクNT by 止丸. The model's metadata declares
# Redistribution_Prohibited under the PIA-PRO license, so the file must never
# be committed. See README.md for how to supply your own.
face/assets/*.vrm
face/assets/*.VRM
*.vrm
*.VRM

# ── Mixamo animation clips (face) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Adobe Mixamo's terms grant a royalty-free licence to *use* the animations in
# your own work; they do not grant the right to redistribute the source FBX.
# These are downloaded under an Adobe account, so they stay out of the repo too.
face/assets/idle/*.fbx
*.fbx

# ── Dependencies ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
face/node_modules

# Python virtualenv (brain)
.venv
__pycache__
*.py[cod]

# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
face/dist
dist
out
build
face/release
*.tgz

# ── Runtime artefacts and dev scratch ───────────────────────────────────
# Screenshots produced by the `--capture` diagnostic, plus any log a debug run
# leaves behind.
*.png
face/capture.png
*.log
*.err
logs
_.log
report.[0-9]_.[0-9]_.[0-9]_.[0-9]_.json

# ── Caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.eslintcache
.cache
.vite
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Editors and OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Coverage ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage
*.lcov
